"{\"encoding\":\"verislop.formalizer-capability-gap/0.1\",\"obligation_ids\":[\"D1\",\"A1\",\"O1\",\"O2\",\"O3\",\"O4\",\"O5\",\"O6\",\"O7\",\"O8\",\"I1\",\"S1\",\"N1\"],\"gaps\":[{\"obligation_ids\":[\"O8\"],\"feature\":\"Primitive connecting contract propositions to actual reconstructed metadata, independent checking events and configured trust boundary\",\"reason\":\"O8 requires retention of actual requirement IDs, kinds, roles and required flags; exact source facets and complete universally refined value facets; independent checking against kernel-reconstructed contracts before proof, after acceptance and at closure; and the configured Tier 2 restricted_source vscore/0.3 scope with natural-language correspondence, host tooling, the pinned Lean kernel, hashing and OS/hardware explicitly trusted. The supplied grammar has no constructor referring to those actual artifacts, checking events or configuration. O8 allows no assumptions. The diagnostic therefore remains a capability gap in the supplied representation, without asserting impossibility, acceptance, source discharge, lifecycle state or an implementation counterexample.\",\"attempted_representations\":[\"Represent contract metadata and checking stages as monomorphic records and lists, and compare them using scalar formulas or total folds. Such values describe stipulated metadata; no registered operation binds them to the actual proposal, kernel reconstruction, independent checking events or configured trust boundary. Quantifying over these records would not supply that missing connection.\",\"Use source_requirements for the actual solve endpoint in program.vscore.json, arity 1, with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only. These constructors preserve endpoint and execution properties but provide no proposition about actual requirement metadata, checking stages or trust configuration.\",\"Preserve the aggregation domain with Input and Event records, nullable integers and ordered output records. Sorted unique group strings, exact integer ceiling-derived bucket ranges, occurrence-preserving filters and sums, and per-group total folds carrying an optional previous sum can express the functional behavior, including zero sums, duplicates, clipped intervals and both fill branches. Complete mixed source/value contracts for O1 through O7 and source-only contracts for I1 and S1 still cannot express O8's independent workflow requirements.\",\"Consider the raw Lean alternative. Its unchanged executable DSL acceptance gates provide no registered artifact or workflow predicate; introducing an opaque predicate, invented assumption, constant metadata equality or source-only proxy would omit O8's required connection to actual contracts and checks.\"]}]}"
